<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Innkeepers started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Innkeepers started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said on Wednesday it had started coverage of Innkeepers USA Trust with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock opened down 1/8 to 11-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
